<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title><%= pageTitle %></title>

  <meta name="description" content="<%= pageDescription %>">
  <meta name="author" content="Justin Bishop">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0d7aff">

  <link rel="icon" href="/public/images/podhaven/icon.png" type="image/png">
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/public/images/podhaven/icon.png">

  <meta property="og:title" content="<%= pageTitle %>">
  <meta property="og:description" content="<%= pageDescription %>">
  <meta property="og:image" content="<%= baseUrl %><%= ogImage %>">
  <meta property="og:url" content="<%= baseUrl %><%= canonicalPath %>">
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta property="og:site_name" content="Artisanal Software">

  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
  <meta name="twitter:title" content="<%= pageTitle %>">
  <meta name="twitter:description" content="<%= pageDescription %>">
  <meta name="twitter:image" content="<%= baseUrl %><%= ogImage %>">

  <link rel="canonical" href="<%= baseUrl %><%= canonicalPath %>">

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="<%= assetUrl('/public/css/podhavenLanding.css') %>">
</head>
<body class="ph-body">
  <header class="ph-nav">
    <div class="ph-container ph-nav-inner">
      <a class="ph-nav-brand" href="/">
        <span class="ph-nav-brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">A</span>
        <span class="ph-nav-brand-text">Artisanal Software</span>
      </a>
      <nav class="ph-nav-links" aria-label="Site navigation">
        <a href="#products">Products</a>
        <a href="#philosophy">Philosophy</a>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="/podhaven" class="ph-nav-cta">PodHaven</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="ph-hero">
    <div class="ph-container ph-hero-grid">
      <div class="ph-hero-copy">
        <div class="ph-eyebrow">Independent Software Studio</div>
        <h1 class="ph-hero-title">Software, made by hand.</h1>
        <p class="ph-hero-sub">Artisanal Software builds thoughtful tools for people who care about the details. Personal software, carefully made and shipped when it's ready.</p>
        <div class="ph-cta-row">
          <a class="ph-cta ph-cta-primary" href="/podhaven">Discover PodHaven</a>
          <a class="ph-cta ph-cta-ghost" href="https://github.com/jubishop" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
          <a class="ph-cta ph-cta-secondary" href="https://discord.gg/cMCJeuVY2f" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join the Discord</a>
        </div>
        <ul class="ph-hero-bullets">
          <li>One person. Hand-tuned. No committee design.</li>
          <li>On-device recommendations built around your taste.</li>
          <li>Source-available — read the code, audit the claims.</li>
          <li>No subscriptions, no surveillance, no enshittification.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <figure class="ph-hero-shot">
        <img src="/public/images/podhaven/episode-detail.png" alt="PodHaven episode detail screen — Artisanal Software's flagship iOS podcast app." width="1320" height="2868" loading="eager">
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ph-section ph-section-alt" id="products">
    <div class="ph-container">
      <div class="ph-eyebrow">Products</div>
      <h2 class="ph-section-title">What we make.</h2>
      <p class="ph-lede">One product today. More to come — but only when each one is worth your time.</p>

      <div class="ph-feature" style="margin-top: 32px;">
        <div class="ph-feature-copy">
          <div class="ph-eyebrow">PodHaven · iOS</div>
          <h2 class="ph-section-title">The podcast app that learns what you actually want to hear.</h2>
          <p>Personal recommendations built and scored entirely on your device. Smart Lists, flexible filters, and custom tags to organize your library. Configurable silence skipping for downloaded episodes and CarPlay for listening on the road. Plus offline listening, transcripts, sharing, widgets, and settings for each podcast’s routine.</p>
          <p>Built on modern Swift, source-available on GitHub, and available now on the App Store.</p>
          <div class="ph-cta-row">
            <a class="ph-cta ph-cta-primary" href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/podhaven/id6744904018">Download on the App Store</a>
            <a class="ph-cta ph-cta-ghost" href="/podhaven">Tour PodHaven</a>
            <a class="ph-cta ph-cta-ghost" href="/podhaven/guides">Read the guides</a>
            <a class="ph-cta ph-cta-ghost" href="https://github.com/jubishop/podhaven" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View on GitHub</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <figure class="ph-feature-shot">
          <img src="/public/images/podhaven/up-next.png" alt="PodHaven Up Next showing a queue of episodes followed by the on-device Recommended section." loading="lazy">
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ph-section" id="philosophy">
    <div class="ph-container">
      <div class="ph-eyebrow">Philosophy</div>
      <h2 class="ph-section-title">Things we believe.</h2>
      <p class="ph-lede">Software has gotten worse, on average, every year for the last decade. We don't think that has to be true.</p>
      <div class="ph-grid">
        <div class="ph-card">
          <h3>Privacy is a feature, not a flag.</h3>
          <p>PodHaven's recommendation model and scoring run on your device. Feeds, search, and downloads use the network. Sentry diagnostics and in-app feedback help us investigate problems.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ph-card">
          <h3>On-device, by default.</h3>
          <p>Modern phones are absurdly capable. Recommendations, search, ranking — they belong on your device, not behind someone else's API key.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ph-card">
          <h3>Source-available.</h3>
          <p>Our code is public. Read it, audit it, fork it, build it yourself. Trust that's grounded in code is the only kind worth having.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ph-card">
          <h3>No subscriptions for software.</h3>
          <p>You should be able to buy software, own it, and keep using it. Recurring revenue isn't a substitute for shipping things people want.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ph-card">
          <h3>Hand-tuned, not template-built.</h3>
          <p>Every interaction, every animation, every margin gets attention. The "hundred small things" are the actual product — they just don't show up on a feature list.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ph-card">
          <h3>Ship when it's ready.</h3>
          <p>No artificial release cadences, no quarterly OKRs forcing half-baked features. We ship when something is good. We don't ship when it isn't.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ph-section ph-section-alt" id="about">
    <div class="ph-container">
      <div class="ph-eyebrow">About</div>
      <h2 class="ph-section-title">A studio of one.</h2>
      <p class="ph-lede">Artisanal Software is the work of <strong style="color: var(--ph-text);">Justin Bishop</strong> — engineer, long-time podcast nerd, and reluctant subscription-skeptic. The studio is small on purpose: one person, deep focus, no roadmap meetings.</p>
      <p class="ph-lede">If you'd like to follow along, the Discord is the most active channel. Code lives on GitHub. Ideas, bug reports, and well-argued disagreements are all welcome.</p>
      <div class="ph-cta-row">
        <a class="ph-cta ph-cta-secondary" href="https://discord.gg/cMCJeuVY2f" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join the Discord</a>
        <a class="ph-cta ph-cta-ghost" href="https://github.com/jubishop" target="_blank" rel="noopener">github.com/jubishop</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer class="ph-footer">
    <div class="ph-container ph-footer-inner">
      <div class="ph-footer-cols">
        <div class="ph-footer-col">
          <h4>Products</h4>
          <a href="/podhaven">PodHaven</a>
          <a href="/podhaven/guides">PodHaven Guides</a>
        </div>
        <div class="ph-footer-col">
          <h4>Project</h4>
          <a href="https://github.com/jubishop" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
          <a href="https://discord.gg/cMCJeuVY2f" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Discord</a>
        </div>
        <div class="ph-footer-col">
          <h4>Studio</h4>
          <a href="#philosophy">Philosophy</a>
          <a href="#about">About</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="ph-footer-meta">© <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Justin Bishop. Artisanal Software is an independent studio. Source-available license.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
